{"id": 79430, "acmi_id": "300380", "title": "Antony and Cleopatra", "title_annotation": "", "slug": "antony-and-cleopatra", "creator_credit": "Jonathan Miller and BBC", "credit_line": "", "headline_credit": "United Kingdom, 1980", "video_links": [], "record_type": "work", "type": "Film", "is_on_display": false, "last_on_display_place": null, "last_on_display_date": null, "is_context_indigenous": false, "material_description": "", "unpublished": false, "external": false, "first_production_date": "1980-01-01T11:00:00+11:00", "commissioned": false, "brief_description": "<p>Episode of Series &#8220;BBC Television Shakespeare Series&#8221;.<br />\nMark Antony and Cleopatra have been enjoying a life of sensual pleasure. Hearing of his wife&#8217;s death and of an attack on Italy, Mark Antony returns to Rome where he resolves the differences existing between himself and the other triumvires, Octavius Caesar and Lepidus, by marrying Octavius&#8217; sister, Octavia. However, when Mark Antony succumbs to Cleopatra&#8217;s enticements once again, and returns to Egypt, Octavius seizes upon this insult to his sister as a pretext for attacking his erstwhile ally.</p>", "constellations_primary": [], "constellations_other": [], "recommendations": [], "title_for_label": "<p>Antony and Cleopatra</p>", "creator_credit_for_label": "<p>Jonathan Miller and BBC</p>", "headline_credit_for_label": "<p>United Kingdom, 1980</p>", "description": "<p>Episode of Series &#8220;BBC Television Shakespeare Series&#8221;.<br />\nMark Antony and Cleopatra have been enjoying a life of sensual pleasure. Hearing of his wife&#8217;s death and of an attack on Italy, Mark Antony returns to Rome where he resolves the differences existing between himself and the other triumvires, Octavius Caesar and Lepidus, by marrying Octavius&#8217; sister, Octavia. However, when Mark Antony succumbs to Cleopatra&#8217;s enticements once again, and returns to Egypt, Octavius seizes upon this insult to his sister as a pretext for attacking his erstwhile ally.</p>", "description_for_label": ["<p>Episode of Series &#8220;BBC Television Shakespeare Series&#8221;.<br />\nMark Antony and Cleopatra have been enjoying a life of sensual pleasure. Hearing of his wife&#8217;s death and of an attack on Italy, Mark Antony returns to Rome where he resolves the differences existing between himself and the other triumvires, Octavius Caesar and Lepidus, by marrying Octavius&#8217; sister, Octavia. However, when Mark Antony succumbs to Cleopatra&#8217;s enticements once again, and returns to Egypt, Octavius seizes upon this insult to his sister as a pretext for attacking his erstwhile ally.</p>"], "credit_line_for_label": "", "details": [{"label": "Duration", "display_values": ["02:57:00:00"]}, {"label": "Language", "display_values": ["English"]}, {"label": "Subject categories", "display_values": ["Adaptations", "Feature films", "Feature films&nbsp;→ Feature films - Great Britain", "History&nbsp;→ Cleopatra, Queen of Egypt, d. 30 B.C.", "Literature&nbsp;→ Shakespeare, William, 1564-1616 - Film and video adaptations", "People&nbsp;→ Cleopatra, Queen of Egypt, d. 30 B.C."]}, {"label": "Sound/audio", "display_values": ["Sound"]}, {"label": "Colour", "display_values": ["Colour"]}], "stats": {"tap_count": 0}, "links": [], "creators_primary": [{"id": 1961603, "name": "Jonathan Miller", "creator_id": 19895, "creator_wikidata_id": null, "role": "director", "role_id": 938, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 1961602, "name": "BBC", "creator_id": 72467, "creator_wikidata_id": null, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}], "creators_other": [{"id": 1961601, "name": "British Broadcasting Corporation", "creator_id": 11896, "creator_wikidata_id": null, "role": "distributor", "role_id": 437, "is_primary": false}], "media_note": "Sorry, we aren't able to make images or video for this item available to the public online.", "holdings": [{"name": "VHS; Access Print (Section 1)", "identifier": "", "description"